yYTVjZmFjNzk2MjJmYzI0MmIyYTk4NDA0NjFmOGY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Claude Code","email":"claude@anthropic.com","date":"2025-11-29T13:57:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"Claude Code","email":"claude@anthropic.com","date":"2025-11-29T13:57:58Z"},"message":"Expanded question database to 320+ questions for Misshka\n\n📚 COMPREHENSIVE QUESTION DATABASE:\n- Total: 320 questions across all subjects\n- NO emojis in questions (completely removed to prevent hints)\n- Organized by difficulty: Easy, Medium, Hard\n\n🔬 SCIENCE (110 questions):\n- Animals: 50 questions (easy: 20, medium: 20, hard: 10)\n- Space: 20 questions (easy: 7, medium: 6, hard: 7)\n- Nature: 20 questions (easy: 7, medium: 6, hard: 7)\n- Physics/Chemistry: 20 questions (easy: 7, medium: 6, hard: 7)\n\n📚 ENGLISH (60 questions):\n- Reading: 20 questions (alphabet, rhymes, opposites, vowels)\n- Vocabulary: 20 questions (everyday objects, baby animals, professions)\n- Grammar: 20 questions (verb forms, punctuation, plurals, contractions)\n\n🌍 GENERAL KNOWLEDGE (50 questions):\n- Geography: 25 questions (oceans, continents, mountains, deserts)\n- Culture/History: 25 questions (holidays, inventions, traditions)\n\n🎨 ART (40 questions):\n- Colors: 20 questions (mixing colors, primary/secondary, color wheel)\n- Creativity/Music: 20 questions (shapes, instruments, 3D objects)\n\n🧩 LOGIC (60 questions):\n- Patterns: 20 questions (number sequences, alphabet, Fibonacci)\n- Puzzles: 20 questions (riddles, brain teasers, word problems)\n- Reasoning: 20 questions (cause-effect, problem-solving)\n\n✨ FEATURES:\n- Zero question repetition with session tracking\n- Adaptive difficulty progression\n- AI-driven question selection\n- Analytics dashboard with performance insights\n- Perfect for 6-year-old learning level","tree":{"sha":"32418afd65e8f33e4de80d0bce8628e5dde247b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/Misshka-Learning-Progress-App/git/trees/32418afd65e8f33e4de80d0bce8628e5dde247b7"},"url":"https://api.github.