hat Misshka loves\n- Interest-based recommendations\n- Difficulty breakdown per subject (easy/medium/hard)\n\n🤖 AI-DRIVEN ADAPTIVE LEARNING:\n- Questions selected based on performance patterns\n- Automatic difficulty progression (3 correct = level up)\n- Personalized audio feedback for achievements\n- Performance tracking stored in localStorage\n- Category-based interest detection\n- Smart question rotation to maximize learning\n\n🎨 IMPROVEMENTS:\n- 6 subjects with distinct icons and descriptions\n- Clean question display (NO visual hints)\n- Comprehensive performance tracking\n- Session persistence across page reloads\n- Real-time streak and level tracking per subject\n- Beautiful analytics dashboard with color-coded insights","tree":{"sha":"a8d5ee5c4e76c631fcaa953da4ea5edc5bd98314","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/Misshka-Learning-Progress-App/git/trees/a8d5ee5c4e76c631fcaa953da4ea5edc5bd98314"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/Misshka-Learning-Progress-App/git/commits/ef24811932bc29554e0d93eed0b46e517b8ae623","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/Misshka-Learning-Progress-App/commits/ef24811932bc29554e0d93eed0b46e517b8ae623","html_url":"https://github.com/Abhillashjadhav/Misshka-Learning-Progress-App/commit/ef24811932bc29554e0d93eed0b46e517b8ae623","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Abhillashjadhav/Misshka-Learning-Progress-App/commits/ef24811932bc29554e0d93eed0b46e517b8ae623/comments","author":{"login":"claude","id":81847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gith